.TH man 1 "06 May 2010" "1.0" "retrode3-dump man page"
.SH NAME
retrode3-dump \- dump a cart
.SH SYNOPSIS
retrode3-dump [USERNAME]
.SH DESCRIPTION
retrode3-dump is a testme.
.SH OPTIONS
The retrode3-dump does not take any options. However, you can supply username.
.SH SEE ALSO
retrode3-wlan(1) 
.SH BUGS
No known bugs.
